  },
  {
    "contentHash": "fed16abeaf6787b984daf2cc1ac23096308a1a0fa6ef628b1e06590b5c395c88",
    "heading": "The French Revolution › Causes",
    "text": "Enlightenment ideas about popular sovereignty and equal rights spread through pamphlets and salons, and gave the Third Estate a language for its grievances against the privileges of the clergy and nobility.",
