    "contentHash": "db81d5bb7e0616f4f9382dec015aa1fe7158112c5f4fbbb6bd717d0980f52652",
    "heading": "The French Revolution › Causes › The storming of the Bastille",
    "text": "On 14 July 1789 a Paris crowd stormed the Bastille, a royal fortress and prison, to seize gunpowder. The day is now France's national holiday.",
